2026-07-27T09:06:46.2631759Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:06:46.2632533Z i /tmp/RtmpCuEWCF/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:06:46.2632881Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:06:46.2633304Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:06:46.2633667Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:06:46.2634208Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:06:46.2634995Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:06:46.2635957Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
